<title>CHINA: Assoc Int'l Hotels year net up 18.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Assoc Int'l Hotels year net up 18.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	  63.0   vs 53.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)   15.5   vs 14.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			   227.15 vs 191.65</p>
<p>    Turnover		    617.47 vs 566.73</p>
<p>    Company name		Associated International Hotels ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 September 5-12</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	  September 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Associated Int'l Hotels is a hotel operator.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 22 H.K. cents (including an interim dividend of 6.5 cents) vs 20 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
